@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix semapv: <https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .

# Term equivalences for the inquiry (erotetic) domain — GMEOW authoring source.
# Compiled to mappings/gmeow-inquiry.sssom.tsv by `gmeow compile-mappings`.
# Aligns the erotetic slice to schema.org's QA vocabulary (Question / answer).

gmeow:mapsetInquiry a gmeow:MappingSet ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-inquiry.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:setId "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mappings/inquiry" ;
    gmeow:license "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" ;
    gmeow:setComment "Erotetic-slice alignments to schema.org's QA vocabulary. The match is deliberately loose (skos:closeMatch, not equivalentClass): schema.org models the QA SPEECH ACT / PAGE — a schema:Question is a posted question on a QAPage with schema:acceptedAnswer / schema:suggestedAnswer answers — whereas gmeow:Question is answerhood-individuated CONTENT, the third content sibling of gmeow:Proposition and gmeow:Goal, neither true/false nor a page. gmeow:answers ranges over vantage-indexed claims (P9), not a single accepted answer, so the schema:acceptedAnswer / schema:suggestedAnswer distinction has no gmeow counterpart and is folded into the standpoint layer. The competency-question (CQ) practice familiar from ontology engineering — a Question as a requirement a model must answer — is the natural consumer of this slice but has no stable IRI vocabulary to map to, so it is referenced in prose only. The question-type vocabulary (gmeow:typeWh / gmeow:typePolar / …) has no stable external IRI counterpart and is intentionally left unmapped.".

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# schema.org — QA vocabulary
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #

gmeow:Question skos:closeMatch schema:Question {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-inquiry.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.9 ;
    gmeow:comment "schema:Question models the QA SPEECH ACT / posted question on a QAPage; gmeow:Question is answerhood-individuated CONTENT (the third content sibling of Proposition and Goal), neither true/false nor a page. closeMatch, not equivalentClass."
|} .

gmeow:answers skos:closeMatch schema:answer {|
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-inquiry.sssom.tsv" ;
    gmeow:justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    gmeow:confidence 0.8 ;
    gmeow:comment "schema:answer links a question to an Answer; its schema:acceptedAnswer / schema:suggestedAnswer lineage (QAPage practice) picks ONE accepted answer, whereas gmeow:answers is vantage-indexed and coexisting (P9) — several answers, none privileged, acceptance carried on the epistemics spine. closeMatch."
|} .
